;; Regulatory source register for cloud-itonami-cofog-07.4 — COFOG 07.4,
;; public health services, as this blueprint implements it: an independent
;; community vector-control and environmental-health SURVEY actor.
;;
;; Until this file existed, the repository's public-health claims — which
;; statute a mosquito-borne-disease survey actually operates under in Japan,
;; which authority grades hospital services, where the national notifiable
;; surveillance data is published — could not be traced to anything. This is
;; that list.
;;
;; Shape is tx-data (a vector of entity maps), like every other EDN corpus in
;; this workspace, so it loads with
;;   (d/transact conn (edn/read-string (slurp "facts.edn")))
;; :source/id is the join key. A statute or page not in this table has NO
;; basis for a claim in this repository — extend the table, never invent an
;; id or a URL.
;;
;; VERIFIED BY `nbb scripts/verify-facts.cljs`, which re-fetches every entry.
;; Each carries a :source/verify tag naming WHICH check establishes it:
;;   :e-gov-law-id   resolved through the e-Gov law API (total_count, title,
;;                   law number). The /law/<id> page's HTTP status is NEVER
;;                   consulted — it answers 200 for any id at all.
;;   :page-identity  2xx, final URL still the page asked for, declared
;;                   charset, and the <title> recorded below.
;;   :page-text      All of :page-identity, plus every string in
;;                   :page/must-contain present in the de-tagged body.
;;
;; CLAIMS STOP AT THE LEVEL ACTUALLY CHECKED: document identity, and for the
;; :page-text entries the strings read on 2026-09-01. No article text, no
;; article numbers, no conformance claim is asserted, because none of that
;; was read. What the register does NOT cover is said in
;; :coverage/not-covered, not left silent.
;;
;; THE HOST ASSUMPTIONS ARE MEASURED AT RUN TIME, NOT DATED IN A COMMENT.
;; The :host-behaviour entities below say what each host does with a path
;; that does not exist; the verifier fetches one on every run and fails if
;; the answer has changed.
;;
;; MEASURED 2026-09-01: BOTH hosts answer **404** for a path that does not
;; exist, and neither served a bot challenge to a paced, serial client.
;; www.mhlw.go.jp refuses with a real 42,503-byte 「お探しのページが見つかり
;; ません。｜厚生労働省」 page at the requested URL — status AND title both
;; separate it from a real page. id-info.jihs.go.jp refuses with a bare
;; 315-byte Apache "404 Not Found" — no site chrome at all. One more host
;; behaviour is load-bearing and is therefore also written down:
;; id-info.jihs.go.jp does NOT redirect http:// to https:// (the http form of
;; a real page answers 404 at port 80), while www.mhlw.go.jp does. The
;; verifier's redirect self-test must aim at the mhlw page, and says so.
;;
;; THE FORMER MINISTRY NAME: 国立感染症研究所 (NIID) was folded into 国立健康
;;危機管理研究機構 (JIHS) in 2025; the surveillance site now lives on
;; id-info.jihs.go.jp. www.niid.go.jp/niid/ja/idwr.html still answers 200 but
;; REDIRECTS there — the register cites the URL the authority actually
;; serves, not the one that forwards to it.

[
 ;; ── What each host does with a path that does not exist ────────────────────
 ;; Re-measured on every run. A change here invalidates the checks that rest
 ;; on it, which is the point of writing it down as data.

 {:source/id "host.www-mhlw-go-jp"
  :source/kind :host-behaviour
  :host/name "www.mhlw.go.jp"
  :host/missing-path :refuses
  :host/missing-status 404
  :source/note "厚生労働省. Answers 404 with a real 42,503-byte
                「お探しのページが見つかりません。｜厚生労働省」 page at the
                requested URL, so status and title both separate a real page
                from an invented one. No bot challenge was served to a paced,
                serial client across every fetch this register was built
                with. http:// redirects to https:// (measured), so this is
                the host the verifier's redirect self-test aims at."}

 {:source/id "host.id-info-jihs-go-jp"
  :source/kind :host-behaviour
  :host/name "id-info.jihs.go.jp"
  :host/missing-path :refuses
  :host/missing-status 404
  :source/note "国立健康危機管理研究機構 感染症情報提供サイト (the former
                国立感染症研究所 surveillance host). Answers 404 with a
                315-byte bare Apache '404 Not Found' body at the requested
                URL — no site chrome, so byte count is what discriminates.
                Does NOT redirect http:// to https://: the http form of a
                cited page answers 404 at port 80. Measured 2026-09-01."}

